{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"javascript-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"JavaScript Snippets","description":"Everyday ES6+ snippets: functions, promises, modules, array methods, DOM and testing.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"JavaScript","path":"snippets/javascript.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/javascript.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Arrow function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"af\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const ${1:name} = (${2:args}) => {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An arrow function\"\n  },\n  \"Async function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"asf\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"async function ${1:name}(${2:args}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An async function\"\n  },\n  \"Import\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"imp\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import ${1:name} from '${2:module}';\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"import ... from\"\n  },\n  \"Import named\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"imn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"import { ${1:name} } from '${2:module}';\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"import { } from\"\n  },\n  \"Export default\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"exd\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"export default ${1:name};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"export default\"\n  },\n  \"Console log\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"cl\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"console.log(${1:value});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"console.log\"\n  },\n  \"Console log labelled\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"cll\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"console.log('${1:label}:', ${1:label});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"console.log with a label\"\n  },\n  \"Try catch\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"tc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"try {\",\n      \"\\t$1\",\n      \"} catch (${2:error}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"try / catch\"\n  },\n  \"Promise\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"prom\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"new Promise\"\n  },\n  \"Fetch JSON\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fj\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const ${1:res} = await fetch(${2:url});\",\n      \"if (!${1:res}.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP \\\\${${1:res}.status}`);\",\n      \"const ${3:data} = await ${1:res}.json();\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"fetch and parse JSON\"\n  },\n  \"For of\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fo\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"for (const ${1:item} of ${2:items}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"for...of\"\n  },\n  \"For in\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fi\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"for (const ${1:key} in ${2:object}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"for...in\"\n  },\n  \"Map\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"map\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:items}.map((${2:item}) => $0)\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Array.map\"\n  },\n  \"Filter\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fil\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:items}.filter((${2:item}) => $0)\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Array.filter\"\n  },\n  \"Reduce\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"red\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:items}.reduce((${2:acc}, ${3:item}) => $0, ${4:0})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Array.reduce\"\n  },\n  \"Destructure\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ds\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const { ${1:a}, ${2:b} } = ${3:object};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Object destructuring\"\n  },\n  \"Class\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"cls\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\tconstructor(${2:args}) {\",\n      \"\\t\\t$0\",\n      \"\\t}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A class\"\n  },\n  \"Set timeout\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"st\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"setTimeout(() => {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}, ${1:1000});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"setTimeout\"\n  },\n  \"Add event listener\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ael\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:element}.addEventListener('${2:click}', (${3:e}) => {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"addEventListener\"\n  },\n  \"Query selector\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"qs\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"document.querySelector('${1:.selector}')\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"querySelector\"\n  },\n  \"Describe and test\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"dt\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"describe('${1:subject}', () => {\",\n      \"\\tit('${2:works}', () => {\",\n      \"\\t\\t$0\",\n      \"\\t});\",\n      \"});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A test group\"\n  },\n  \"Expect\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ex\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"expect(${1:value}).${2:toBe}(${3:expected});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"expect\"\n  },\n  \"IIFE\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"iife\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"(() => {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"})();\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Immediately invoked function\"\n  },\n  \"Debounce\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"deb\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"function debounce(fn, ms = ${1:200}) {\",\n      \"\\tlet t;\",\n      \"\\treturn (...args) => {\",\n      \"\\t\\tclearTimeout(t);\",\n      \"\\t\\tt = setTimeout(() => fn(...args), ms);\",\n      \"\\t};\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A debounce helper\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# JavaScript Snippets\n\nEveryday ES6+ snippets: functions, promises, modules, array methods, DOM and testing.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 24 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| JavaScript | `af` | An arrow function |\n| JavaScript | `asf` | An async function |\n| JavaScript | `imp` | import ... from |\n| JavaScript | `imn` | import { } from |\n| JavaScript | `exd` | export default |\n| JavaScript | `cl` | console.log |\n| JavaScript | `cll` | console.log with a label |\n| JavaScript | `tc` | try / catch |\n| JavaScript | `prom` | new Promise |\n| JavaScript | `fj` | fetch and parse JSON |\n| JavaScript | `fo` | for...of |\n| JavaScript | `fi` | for...in |\n| JavaScript | `map` | Array.map |\n| JavaScript | `fil` | Array.filter |\n| JavaScript | `red` | Array.reduce |\n| JavaScript | `ds` | Object destructuring |\n| JavaScript | `cls` | A class |\n| JavaScript | `st` | setTimeout |\n| JavaScript | `ael` | addEventListener |\n| JavaScript | `qs` | querySelector |\n| JavaScript | `dt` | A test group |\n| JavaScript | `ex` | expect |\n| JavaScript | `iife` | Immediately invoked function |\n| JavaScript | `deb` | A debounce helper |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}